  "ID": "56587",
  "post_title": "Gin-tonic con la Onda Big Band en Druida, con Jamón en Colonial y Noche Latina en Década",
  "post_date": "2015-06-04 09:00:18",
  "post_name": "gin-tonic-con-la-onda-big-band-en-druida-con-jamon-en-colonial-y-noche-latina-en-decada",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias|Sociedad",
  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">El &uacute;ltimo fin de semana de la Ruta del Gin-tonic, algunos locales de Hosturionda han programado actividades.</span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/06/P1030664.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">En cafeter&iacute;a Druida, en la calle Ausi&agrave;s March, 45, ha actuado la Onda Big Band.</span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/06/P1030912.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Colonial, en la calle Joan Fuster, 69, ha celebrado la Fiesta del Jam&oacute;n y ha repetido el &eacute;xito del 15 de mayo en La Cantina Colonial, de la Font de Dins.</span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/06/PnocheLatinaDecada-15.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">El pub D&eacute;cada, en la avenida Pa&iacute;s Valenci&agrave;, 110, ha programado la Noche Latina, con el dj especializado Julio C&eacute;sar Aldana.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/garitoscapsetmana2931maig15/p1030644.jpg\" alt=\"p1030644\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/garitoscapsetmana2931maig15/p1030645.jpg\" alt=\"p1030645\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/garitoscapsetmana2931maig15/p1030646.jpg\" alt=\"p1030646\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/garitoscapsetmana2931maig15/p1030647.jpg\" alt=\"p1030647\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/garitoscapsetmana2931maig15/p1030649.jpg\" alt=\"p1030649\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/garitoscapsetmana2931maig15/p1030650.jpg\" alt=\"p1030650\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/garitoscapsetmana2931maig15/p1030652.jpg\" alt=\"p1030652\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/garitoscapsetmana2931maig15/p1030653.jpg\" alt=\"p1030653\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/garitoscapsetmana2931maig15/p1030654.jpg\" alt=\"p1030654\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/garitoscapsetmana2931maig15/p1030656.jpg\" alt=\"p1030656\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/garitoscapsetmana2931maig15/p1030657.jpg\" alt=\"p1030657\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/garitoscapsetmana2931maig15/p1030659.jpg\" alt=\"p1030659\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/garitoscapsetmana2931maig15/p1030660.jpg\" alt=\"p1030660\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/garitoscapsetmana2931maig15/p1030661.jpg\" alt=\"p1030661\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/garitoscapsetmana2931maig15/p1030662.jpg\" alt=\"p1030662\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d